{"id":429,"gn":"Pokémon Magique","ft":["Pareil à une incantation magique, son cri n’est que très rarement source de joie.","Il psalmodie des incantations. Ce sont souvent des malédictions, mais certaines apportent la joie.","Un Pokémon insaisissable qui tourmente ses ennemis avec son cri semblable à une incantation.","Un Pokémon aux pouvoirs terrifiants : il sort de nulle part en maugréant des incantations et en lançant des malédictions.","Comme Magirêve aurait le pouvoir de réaliser les souhaits des amoureux, certaines personnes se lancent désespérément à sa poursuite.","Redouté pour ses sortilèges et ses malédictions, ce Pokémon peut néanmoins faire preuve de bienveillance, si l’envie lui en prend.","Il susurre des malédictions pour tourmenter ses ennemis et leur infliger de terribles migraines ou des hallucinations terrifiantes."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":2,"25":1,"26":2,"27":3,"28":4,"29":5,"30":6},"gr":4,"cr":45,"hc":25,"bh":35,"eg":["Amorphe"],"gw":"fast","gm":{"sv":[0,115],"la":[0,198],"bdsp":[0,73],"usum":[0,373],"usum*":[3,120],"sm":[0,67],"sm*":[0,67],"pt":[0,73],"dp":[0,73]},"f":{"429":{"n":"Magirêve","t":["ghost"],"s":[60,60,60,105,105,105],"h":0.9,"w":4.4,"a":[[26,0]],"av":["sv","la","bdsp","usum","sm","pt","dp"],"ls":[{"l":[[45,1],[180,1],[310,1],[345,1],[408,1],[566,1],[595,1]],"m":[60,63,85,86,87,94,101,109,129,156,164,168,174,180,182,184,196,203,204,214,220,240,241,244,247,248,261,263,269,270,271,285,286,304,313,345,347,399,408,412,416,417,433,447,451,473,492,500,506,566,577,605,807,808,809,851,883,917]},{"l":[[425,1],[93,6],[95,11],[506,18],[326,25],[408,34],[247,43]]},{"l":[[310,1],[109,1],[93,1],[45,1],[288,1],[506,1],[345,1],[212,1],[595,1],[220,1],[371,1],[195,1],[566,1],[408,1],[60,1],[247,1],[180,1]],"m":[63,85,86,87,94,104,138,148,156,164,168,182,203,207,213,214,240,241,244,247,259,261,263,269,285,332,347,351,371,399,412,416,417,433,451,605]},{"l":[[595,1],[408,1],[566,1],[381,1],[345,1],[45,1],[149,1],[180,1],[310,1]],"m":[63,85,86,8